      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The message shown in OP is agnostic to the world, if you hit the HTTP 429 Too Many Requests rate limit response by being stuck in the loop then you'll be sent to the error world temporarily anyway.\n\n\"Go Home\" wouldn't do anything good here, it's already doing its best to get you back in.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
